## Arachnid
species-pros-arachnid-1 = Can produce silk and craft clothes, shields and walls from it
species-pros-arachnid-2 = Fast unarmed attacks dealing 5 slash damage
species-pros-arachnid-3 = Get hungry and thirsty ~27% slower
species-cons-arachnid-1 = Take 50% more blunt and fire damage
